<!--
    April Fools' Day: the G wears googly eyes, staring at a jack-in-the-box beside it. The clown has just sprung out and
    boings to a stop; it ducks back in and the lid slams, the eyes wander, then the box starts to rattle and - pop! - out
    it comes again, with the pupils rattling round at the shock. One 3.6s loop.

    See doodle_halloween.xml for the layout: a 48x48 viewport around the widget's own G (12..36), which isn't drawn here.
-->
